    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      204.17,
      397.18,
      229.43
    ],
    "text": "provisions of the Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      245.93,
      397.19,
      271.19
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      287.57,
      397.19,
      354.59
    ],
    "text": "(a)to promote the awareness of the general public onall matters pertaining to heart diseases includingthe cause and prevention of such diseases byorganinsing lectures, seminars and other pertinentprogrammes;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      370.97,
      397.23,
      424.07
    ],
    "text": "(b)to provide financial assistance to heart patients inneed of funds who seek teartments particularly atSri Jayawardenepura Hospital and other hospitalsin Sri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      440.45,
      397.18,
      479.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)to do all such other acts and things as are incidentalor conducive to the attainment of the objectives ofthe Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      496.13,
      397.21,
      563.03
    ],
    "text": "(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without any distinctionbased on race, religion, language, caste, sex, politicalopinion, place of birth or any of such grounds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      579.53,
      397.18,
      646.55
    ],
    "text": "4.The objects of the Corporation shall be carried out insuch manner so as not to create any conflict between thework of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or a Department of theGovernment or of any Provincial Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      246.31,
      449.6,
      274.58
    ],
    "text": "Generalobjects of theCorporation",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      580.75,
      450.44,
      661.82
    ],
    "text": "Corporationto ensure noconflict withthe work of aMinistry or aDepartmentof theGovernmentor a Province",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
