    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      204.65,
      401.89,
      288.47
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) Subject to the provisions of this Act, themanagement and administration of the affairs of theCorporation shall be carried out by a Board of Directors(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cBoard\u201d) consisting of suchnumber of office bearers as may be specified by the rulesmade under section 7.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      306.05,
      401.91,
      375.47
    ],
    "text": "(2) (a) The Trustees of the Trust Fund holding office onthe day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act, shall function as the Board of the Corporationuntil the first Committee is appointed or elected in themanner provided for by rules made under section 7.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      393.05,
      401.9,
      433.43
    ],
    "text": "(b) The first Board of the Corporation shall be appointedor elected within one year of the date of commencement ofthis Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      451.13,
      401.91,
      520.43
    ],
    "text": "(3) (a) Every office bearer of the Board including thepatrons and advisers, shall be appointed or elected for aperiod of three years and any such office beareer, patron oradvisor shall be eligible for re-appointment or re-electionafter lapse of the said period of three years.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      538.13,
      401.9,
      607.43
    ],
    "text": "(b) In the event of a vacancy occurring due to thedeath, resignation, incapacity or removal from office of anoffice bearer, the Board shall having regard to the rules ofthe Corporation, elect or appoint a person to fill suchvacancy.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      625.13,
      401.89,
      665.39
    ],
    "text": "(c) The person elected or appointed under paragraph (b)shall hold office only for the unexpired portion of the termof office of the member whom he succeeds",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      206.11,
      453.58,
      243.98
    ],
    "text": "Managementof the affairsof theCorporation",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      166.97,
      331.14,
      178.31
    ],
    "text": "4Heart to Heart Trust Fund",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      245.35,
      178.97,
      309.07,
      190.31
    ],
    "text": "(Incorporation)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      204.65,
      397.21,
      268.07
    ],
    "text": "6.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts and matters as are necessaryor desirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation or any one of them, including the power\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      281.33,
      397.22,
      354.23
    ],
    "text": "(a)to purchase, acquire, rent, construct, renovate andotherwise obtain lands or buildings which may berequired for the purposes of the Corporation and todeal with or dispose of the same as may be deemedexpedient with a view to promoting the objects ofthe Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      367.49,
      397.18,
      403.43
    ],
    "text": "(b)to borrow or raise funds with or without securitiesand to receive grants, gifts or donations in cash orgoods:",
