  },
  {
    "page_number": 8,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      562.73,
      397.2,
      623.75
    ],
    "text": "15.(1) The seal of the Corporation shall not be affixedto any instrument whatsoever, except in the presence twomembers of the Board who shall sign their names to theinstrument in token of their presence and such signing shallbe independent of the signing of any person as a witness.",
