    ],
    "text": "16.(1) If upon the dissolution of the Corporation, thereremains after the satisfaction of all its debts and liabilitiesany property whatsoever, such property shall not bedistributed among the members of the Corporation, but shallbe given or transferred to any other institution having objectssimilar to those of the Corporation, and which, is by therules thereof, prohibited from distributing any income orproperty among its or their members.",
